   "por_que": [
    "A covers every piece the client named, including the plant, and stays in light wood, white and cream with green accents, which suits the bright white room and pale floor. B leaves out the plant and uses medium-to-dark walnut on the coffee table and TV cabinet plus a darker ombre rug, which goes against the light-wood, luminous look the client asked for.",
    "B delivers every piece the client named, including the light wood coffee table, the plant and green cushions for color, in a bright, cohesive palette that suits the white room. A leaves out the plant and uses medium and dark woods instead of light wood, though its larger rug and better proportioned pieces are stronger, and B's small table and modest shag rug could be upsized."
