   "por_que": [
    "A delivers exactly what was asked: a pale solid-wood table for four, simple black wooden chairs, a white bell pendant and a low sideboard, all in a coherent Nordic look; only the knotty yellowish pine of the open-cube sideboard is a slight mismatch with the birch and the kitchen's greige wood. B's table has a white top rather than the light wood requested, and the gold-legged herringbone sideboard leans glam rather than simple Nordic, so the set feels less unified.",
    "B delivers what the client asked for: a solid light-wood table with simple black chairs and a plain white pendant, all clearly Nordic. Its only weak point is the yellowish pine open-cube sideboard. A's white-topped table isn't the light wood requested, and its sideboard's gold legs push toward glam rather than simple Nordic."
