   "por_que": [
    "Proposal A delivers the Nordic, light-wood look the client asked for: an ash desk, a birch bentwood rocker and a white bookcase that sit well with the pale floor and white walls. Its only weak spot is the hard shell chair, which isn't really 'cómoda'. Proposal B mixes grey-washed, honey and espresso tones with farmhouse and traditional pieces (rattan doors, wingback), so it drifts from the requested style and doesn't read as one cohesive look.",
    "Proposal B delivers a cohesive Nordic look in light ash, birch and white that suits the white walls and pale floor; its only weak point is the hard plywood shell chair, which is less comfortable than the client asked for. Proposal A mixes gray-washed, honey and espresso woods with industrial and traditional styles, so it drifts away from the light-wood Nordic brief and doesn't read as one designed look."
